{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help","content_id":"80bd7b88-f2a8-44fa-b49e-c588b5b38400","description":"Information on how you can support people affected by the earthquakes in Venezuela.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>If you want to donate money to support those affected by the earthquakes in Venezuela, there are a number of trusted charities and organisations providing humanitarian relief on the ground.</p>\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-steps-up-support-for-venezuela-following-devastating-earthquakes\">UK government has matched donations from the British public</a> to the Disasters Emergency Committee (DEC) appeal to the value of £2 million, helping trusted UK charities reach those most in need with food, shelter and essential supplies.</p>\n\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Warning\" class=\"application-notice help-notice\">\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://donation.dec.org.uk/venezuela-earthquake-appeal\">Donate to the Disasters Emergency Committee’s Venezuela earthquake appeal</a></p>\n</div>\n\n  <figure class=\"image embedded\"><div class=\"img\"><img src=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a452c66d200ca05e289e2d3/s960_DEC_APPEAL_GOV_01.png\" alt=\"\"></div></figure>\n</div>\n\n<p>The UK immediately <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-deploys-search-and-rescue-team-and-emergency-funding-to-support-venezuela-earthquake-response\">committed £2 million to support the humanitarian response in Venezuela, to support lifesaving humanitarian efforts</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"donating-essential-supplies\">Donating essential supplies</h2>\n\n<p>One of the best ways to help is by donating cash through trusted charities and aid organisations, rather than donating goods. Cash can be transferred quickly to areas where it is needed, and individuals and aid organisations can use it to buy what is most needed.</p>\n\n<p>Unsolicited donations of goods, although well-meant, can obstruct supply chains and delay more urgent life-saving assistance from getting through. If you wish to donate goods, check with charities and community groups. They will have lists of items they need.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"making-your-donation-safely\">Making your donation safely</h2>\n\n<p>Charities with experience of responding to disasters are best placed to reach victims on the ground. There are some simple steps you can take to ensure your money is safe and being used effectively:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>check the charity’s name and registration number using the relevant charity register tool in your country. In the UK you can use the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/find-charity-information\">charity register tool</a>\n</li>\n  <li>most charities with an income of £5,000 or more must be registered, which means they are regulated by the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/charity-commission\">Charity Commission (England and Wales)</a>, the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.oscr.org.uk/\">Office of the Scottish Charity Regulator</a> (Scotland), or <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.charitycommissionni.org.uk/\">The Charity Commission for Northern Ireland</a> (Northern Ireland)</li>\n  <li>make sure the charity is genuine before giving any financial information</li>\n  <li>if in doubt, ask the charity or organisation for more information</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Read more: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/support-registered-charities-to-help-earthquake-aid-efforts-in-venezuela\">Support registered charities to help earthquake aid efforts in Venezuela</a>.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"image embedded\"><div class=\"img\"><img src=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4654fa1c8bd7ce25a5e9be/s960_Venezuela-appeal.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<figcaption><p>UK International Search and Rescue Team specialists, search dogs and critical equipment were sent to Venezuela on 26 June 2026.</p></figcaption></figure>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The UK government has now matched donations from the British public to the Disasters Emergency Committee (DEC) appeal to the value of £2 million.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-02T14:12:06Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-01T10:38:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26"],"political":true},"document_type":"news_story","first_published_at":"2026-07-01T11:38:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help","base_path":"/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help","content_id":"80bd7b88-f2a8-44fa-b49e-c588b5b38400","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:12:06Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Venezuela earthquakes: what you can do to help","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help.es-419","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help.es-419","base_path":"/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help.es-419","content_id":"80bd7b88-f2a8-44fa-b49e-c588b5b38400","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"es-419","public_updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:12:06Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Terremotos en Venezuela: qué puede hacer para ayudar","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/venezuela-earthquakes-what-you-can-do-to-help.es-419","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-main-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de48fa8f5490aff83b4/s300_fcdo-main-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Foreign, Commonwealth<br/>&amp; Development Office"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","content_id":"9dbff654-cdeb-4ebe-9a12-cd4cc20a033e","details":{"current":false,"ended_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00","started_on":"2024-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2024 to 2026 Starmer Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2024-starmer-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-offi